ite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">193b36</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Metaph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1036b14</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">16</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">nominate</b>, Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">dicere [dictatorem</b>], <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36.26</span> </span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>). (Cf. Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">lěgo, legio, legulus</b> ('olivegatherer').)</div></div>"}